WEBVTT

00:00:00.230 --> 00:00:05.230
Action 4/24ths.

00:00:02.810 --> 00:00:04.980
How do you feel?

00:00:06.980 --> 00:00:09.280
How about you just tell us already?

00:00:11.950 --> 00:00:18.080
Where did you hide the 20 million?

00:00:18.080 --> 00:00:19.160
Switzerland?

00:00:19.160 --> 00:00:20.040
Mexico?

00:00:22.540 --> 00:00:24.870
Listen, Bentona.

00:00:24.870 --> 00:00:30.420
The town of Patterson is already under the control of the New York Family.

00:00:30.420 --> 00:00:34.630
Your hick gang doesn't have a chance against us.

00:00:37.140 --> 00:00:40.390
We're not going to kill you.

00:00:40.390 --> 00:00:45.400
If you just give us the 20 million, we'll let you live as you always have.

00:00:48.520 --> 00:00:51.900
Or do you want to die that badly?

00:00:53.900 --> 00:00:55.320
What's wrong?

00:00:55.320 --> 00:00:56.530
What's so funny?

00:00:57.200 --> 00:01:00.540
You're finished, Don Giovanni.

00:01:02.160 --> 00:01:05.040
So you've still got that much energy left?

00:01:05.040 --> 00:01:09.040
I asked a certain man to kill you.

00:01:09.040 --> 00:01:10.300
What?

00:01:11.130 --> 00:01:17.300
An ultra-skilled sniper that you thugs can't possibly hope to defeat.

00:01:18.180 --> 00:01:19.350
Quiet!

00:01:19.350 --> 00:01:20.970
You can't bluff me.

00:01:20.970 --> 00:01:26.770
Even as we speak, he's somewhere in this city, getting ready.

00:01:44.410 --> 00:01:54.260
hissori to iki wo hisome machitsudzuketa kokoro tada kakimushirinagara

00:01:44.410 --> 00:01:54.260
I held my breath and kept waiting while my heart was scratched away

00:01:56.090 --> 00:02:05.600
ippun ichibyou ga konna ni mo nagaku kanjiru koto ha nakatta

00:01:56.090 --> 00:02:05.600
A minute, a second never felt so long

00:02:06.100 --> 00:02:17.360
sora wo miage kaze ni koikakeru ima boku ha Oh tobidaseru ka

00:02:06.100 --> 00:02:17.360
I look up at the sky and ask the wind, "Can I fly now?"

00:02:17.570 --> 00:02:23.660
kako no yowai jibun ha mou inai

00:02:17.570 --> 00:02:23.660
The weak person I was is no more

00:02:23.910 --> 00:02:29.250
tada shinjiru koto ni kimeta

00:02:23.910 --> 00:02:29.250
I decided to just believe

00:02:30.580 --> 00:02:36.380
egaita yume wo ima kono te ni shite

00:02:30.580 --> 00:02:36.380
With the dreams I once had in my hand now

00:02:36.380 --> 00:02:40.220
kimi no hou he

00:02:36.380 --> 00:02:40.220
I go towards you

00:02:42.140 --> 00:02:47.930
kowarete kanjita kono omoi se ni shite

00:02:42.140 --> 00:02:47.930
Carrying those emotions I felt when I broke

00:02:47.930 --> 00:02:52.060
kimi no hou he

00:02:47.930 --> 00:02:52.060
I go towards you

00:02:52.060 --> 00:02:56.110
kaze ni fukarete

00:02:52.060 --> 00:02:56.110
Blown by the wind

00:02:56.860 --> 00:03:01.570
ohh fukarete

00:02:56.860 --> 00:03:01.570
Oh blown

00:03:03.200 --> 00:03:06.830
Action in 4/24

00:03:23.760 --> 00:03:24.850
Calm down.

00:03:27.720 --> 00:03:31.810
Your first job is gonna be a big one.

00:03:32.600 --> 00:03:33.900
Leave it to us.

00:03:33.900 --> 00:03:37.820
Golgo 13 is a worthy adversary.

00:03:38.570 --> 00:03:40.700
It's a chance for us to become famous in an instant.

00:03:41.320 --> 00:03:42.570
But listen,

00:03:42.570 --> 00:03:43.950
just like I said-

00:03:43.950 --> 00:03:45.950
We know, boss.

00:03:45.950 --> 00:03:47.740
The three of us will attack him at once.

00:03:50.410 --> 00:03:51.250
Boss.

00:03:56.380 --> 00:03:57.960
It's him.

00:03:57.960 --> 00:03:59.340
I'm sure of it.

00:03:59.340 --> 00:04:00.380
He's Golgo 13.

00:04:15.020 --> 00:04:16.150
Okay, go.

00:04:24.450 --> 00:04:26.410
Follow them slowly.

00:04:26.410 --> 00:04:28.280
Don't let him notice you.

00:04:41.300 --> 00:04:43.260
It's almost time.

00:05:19.790 --> 00:05:20.550
That's enough.

00:05:20.550 --> 00:05:21.460
Floor it!

00:05:21.460 --> 00:05:22.000
O-Okay.

00:05:30.100 --> 00:05:34.390
Anyway, those three didn't have a chance.

00:05:34.390 --> 00:05:38.100
No, they performed their duty splendidly.

00:05:38.860 --> 00:05:43.110
Their only job was to get Golgo to draw his gun.

00:05:46.280 --> 00:05:49.240
Now we'll know the secret of Golgo's speed draw.

00:05:49.950 --> 00:05:52.620
We've gained some very valuable film.

00:06:07.760 --> 00:06:09.640
We've finished putting it up.

00:06:10.550 --> 00:06:13.720
OK, I'll test its quality.

00:06:13.720 --> 00:06:14.310
Hey.

00:06:14.310 --> 00:06:15.020
Yes!

00:06:33.580 --> 00:06:34.950
Well?

00:06:34.950 --> 00:06:36.120
How's the glass?

00:06:36.830 --> 00:06:39.620
Amazing... it's not even scratched.

00:06:40.500 --> 00:06:42.170
Pay them.

00:06:42.170 --> 00:06:42.840
Yes sir!

00:06:43.630 --> 00:06:48.970
That fool Bentona hired Golgo 13 to kill me.

00:06:50.380 --> 00:06:56.600
Even the legendary sniper will be helpless against this special bulletproof glass.

00:06:56.600 --> 00:06:57.600
Indeed.

00:06:57.600 --> 00:07:01.770
But I don't have the time to wait for him to come for me.

00:07:01.770 --> 00:07:04.940
We'll take him out first.

00:07:04.940 --> 00:07:06.900
Leave it to me.

00:07:06.900 --> 00:07:08.650
You're quite confident.

00:07:08.650 --> 00:07:09.110
Indeed.

00:07:09.110 --> 00:07:14.620
I heard he took out three of your men in less than a second.

00:07:14.620 --> 00:07:18.160
They were sacrifices in order to gain the data I needed.

00:07:18.160 --> 00:07:21.870
I've called the three best men from my assassination squad.

00:07:23.630 --> 00:07:28.630
His next move will be his last.

00:07:29.760 --> 00:07:32.130
I'll look forward to that.

00:07:46.730 --> 00:07:48.820
Please, Golgo 13.

00:07:48.820 --> 00:07:51.150
Kill Don Giovanni!

00:08:00.080 --> 00:08:05.330
The town of Patterson is mine; I've run it for 20 years!

00:08:05.330 --> 00:08:07.750
A lot happened,

00:08:07.750 --> 00:08:10.840
but I finally managed to make my organization what it is today.

00:08:10.840 --> 00:08:14.220
But all of a sudden...

00:08:14.840 --> 00:08:21.850
Don Giovanni of the New York Family came and told me to hand over the territory that I had built up over 20 years!

00:08:22.980 --> 00:08:26.650
They killed five of my best men,

00:08:26.650 --> 00:08:29.360
and now they're trying to take our money!

00:08:30.570 --> 00:08:32.360
I'm not as young as I used to be.

00:08:32.360 --> 00:08:37.320
At this age, there's nothing worse than having that which you built taken from you.

00:08:37.320 --> 00:08:38.830
But...

00:08:38.830 --> 00:08:41.160
their organization is huge.

00:08:41.160 --> 00:08:43.660
We can't possibly defeat them.

00:08:45.710 --> 00:08:47.710
Please, Golgo 13.

00:08:47.710 --> 00:08:49.170
Kill Don Giovanni.

00:08:49.920 --> 00:08:52.510
I'll pay you as much as you want.

00:08:52.510 --> 00:08:53.880
I can't ask anyone but you.

00:08:54.630 --> 00:08:57.890
Please, kill him, kill the Don of the New York Family!

00:08:58.970 --> 00:09:02.390
If you don't do this, then my life will have no meaning!

00:09:02.390 --> 00:09:06.980
If I become his slave, then why...

00:09:06.980 --> 00:09:09.820
Why have I lived?

00:10:06.960 --> 00:10:08.250
Get in!

00:10:10.500 --> 00:10:11.130
Quickly!

00:10:22.220 --> 00:10:23.640
Who are they?

00:10:23.640 --> 00:10:25.060
Just watching me.

00:10:26.060 --> 00:10:27.640
Please, run away.

00:10:28.390 --> 00:10:31.060
Bentona was killed.

00:10:32.480 --> 00:10:33.150
When?

00:10:33.150 --> 00:10:36.570
Just a little while ago.

00:10:37.190 --> 00:10:39.160
His broken body was found in some garbage bags.

00:10:40.660 --> 00:10:44.120
But, he was smiling.

00:10:45.450 --> 00:10:47.450
It was thanks to you.

00:10:47.450 --> 00:10:50.170
He asked you to kill Don Giovanni.

00:10:50.830 --> 00:10:53.920
He knows that you're going to make him pay.

00:10:53.920 --> 00:10:55.670
That's why he died smiling.

00:10:56.920 --> 00:10:59.630
Bentona's organization disbanded.

00:10:59.630 --> 00:11:01.680
We're going to Los Angeles.

00:11:02.390 --> 00:11:04.640
From Los Angeles, I'm going back to the city I was born in.

00:11:05.180 --> 00:11:09.690
So please, just leave New York.

00:11:11.190 --> 00:11:12.690
Have them stop the car.

00:11:12.690 --> 00:11:14.440
It's dangerous.

00:11:14.440 --> 00:11:16.690
The Don is after your life!

00:11:20.400 --> 00:11:22.700
How did they find out about me?

00:11:23.700 --> 00:11:25.200
Did Bentona talk?

00:11:25.830 --> 00:11:27.790
The boss wasn't that kind of guy!

00:11:28.200 --> 00:11:30.210
That's just how powerful their organization is.

00:11:31.040 --> 00:11:32.880
And the Don of the New York Family

00:11:32.880 --> 00:11:38.710
has replaced all the windows of his room on the 21st floor of the Grand Hotel with special bulletproof glass.

00:11:39.220 --> 00:11:45.390
Your client is dead, so there's no reason to risk it.

00:11:45.390 --> 00:11:46.930
Have them stop the car.

00:11:47.600 --> 00:11:49.390
Once I've started a job,

00:11:49.390 --> 00:11:51.440
I have no interest in listening to anyone but the client.

00:11:51.440 --> 00:11:54.100
I'm Bentona's wife.

00:11:54.100 --> 00:11:56.940
So I have the right to refuse the job.

00:11:59.570 --> 00:12:00.900
Please.

00:12:00.900 --> 00:12:04.110
You're the last card that Bentona played.

00:12:04.570 --> 00:12:05.780
For his sake as well...

00:12:05.780 --> 00:12:06.950
Stop the car.

00:12:06.950 --> 00:12:09.200
Do you want to die like a dog?

00:12:09.910 --> 00:12:10.910
Stop the car.

00:12:41.860 --> 00:12:43.530
So, everyone is here.

00:12:44.240 --> 00:12:46.370
Let's get right to the point:

00:12:46.370 --> 00:12:49.450
it's a job from Don Giovanni of the New York Family,

00:12:49.450 --> 00:12:52.290
and your job is to take out an assassin who's trying to kill him.

00:12:53.040 --> 00:12:56.580
Seeing that you've got the three of us together at once,

00:12:56.580 --> 00:13:00.880
that assassin must be pretty tough.

00:13:00.880 --> 00:13:02.590
That's right.

00:13:02.590 --> 00:13:03.800
So, who is he?

00:13:05.300 --> 00:13:06.300
Golgo 13.

00:13:07.850 --> 00:13:09.310
Golgo 13...

00:13:09.970 --> 00:13:12.310
He is a worthy opponent.

00:13:12.310 --> 00:13:14.690
But failure is not an option.

00:13:14.690 --> 00:13:17.310
The true value of your assassination squad will be tested in this mission.

00:13:18.110 --> 00:13:19.820
Keep that in mind.

00:13:24.110 --> 00:13:25.740
First, look at this.

00:13:50.390 --> 00:13:52.310
What do you think?

00:13:52.970 --> 00:13:54.480
He's fast.

00:13:54.480 --> 00:13:58.150
They say he's lasted this long as a lone wolf,

00:13:58.150 --> 00:14:00.860
so I thought he must be pretty tricky.

00:14:00.860 --> 00:14:03.480
But his skills are the real thing.

00:14:03.480 --> 00:14:08.610
There were 0.18 to 0.19 seconds between the time he started drawing his gun and finished turning around.

00:14:08.610 --> 00:14:10.950
It didn't even take 0.2 seconds.

00:14:11.740 --> 00:14:13.330
Look once more.

00:14:15.500 --> 00:14:16.330
Here.

00:14:17.330 --> 00:14:20.580
Listen, here's where it gets interesting.

00:14:21.210 --> 00:14:22.340
Watch carefully.

00:14:26.720 --> 00:14:30.140
In this frame, Golgo has completely drawn his gun.

00:14:30.140 --> 00:14:32.350
This is the fourth frame since he started moving.

00:14:32.930 --> 00:14:35.180
And he's already aimed.

00:14:36.560 --> 00:14:40.480
This camera is set to record 24 frames per second.

00:14:40.480 --> 00:14:47.320
In other words, calculating from this, we can assume that Golgo 13's handgun draw speed is 4/24ths of a second,

00:14:47.320 --> 00:14:49.570
approximately 0.17 seconds.

00:14:51.030 --> 00:14:52.570
0.17?

00:14:53.490 --> 00:14:55.290
And once he's drawn,

00:14:55.290 --> 00:14:58.790
it takes 1/24th of a second for him to shoot one of them,

00:14:58.790 --> 00:15:01.580
in other words, 0.04 seconds.

00:15:03.710 --> 00:15:05.590
0.04 seconds...

00:15:06.260 --> 00:15:08.090
Truly a master.

00:15:13.300 --> 00:15:16.600
But you are the three best members of my assassination squad.

00:15:17.430 --> 00:15:23.610
The three of you together are a match for even Golgo 13.

00:15:23.610 --> 00:15:25.770
Defeat him, no matter what.

00:15:25.770 --> 00:15:28.110
No matter what!

00:15:28.780 --> 00:15:29.820
Understood?

00:15:46.460 --> 00:15:48.300
Will he...

00:15:48.300 --> 00:15:51.760
Will Golgo 13 really come?

00:15:51.760 --> 00:15:53.470
You think he ran?

00:15:53.470 --> 00:15:54.930
Yes.

00:15:54.930 --> 00:15:58.020
He's probably aware of Bentona's death.

00:15:58.720 --> 00:16:00.890
With his client dead,

00:16:00.890 --> 00:16:04.480
no one will complain if he decides not to do it.

00:16:04.480 --> 00:16:06.480
There's no reason to take the risk.

00:16:07.940 --> 00:16:09.490
What do you three think?

00:16:10.150 --> 00:16:11.740
He'll come.

00:16:11.740 --> 00:16:12.490
I know it.

00:16:12.490 --> 00:16:15.490
Yes, no matter what it takes.

00:16:15.490 --> 00:16:21.250
Even if he knows it will cost him his life, he will come.

00:16:21.910 --> 00:16:23.580
Do you understand?

00:16:23.580 --> 00:16:26.920
That's the destiny of a professional assassin.

00:16:31.880 --> 00:16:32.340
It's me.

00:16:33.090 --> 00:16:34.930
I've found Golgo 13.

00:16:34.930 --> 00:16:37.350
The East Village, East 13th Avenue.

00:16:37.970 --> 00:16:40.350
He's heading south on Grand Avenue.

00:16:40.350 --> 00:16:42.940
Keep tailing him.

00:16:42.940 --> 00:16:44.850
But don't touch him.

00:16:45.560 --> 00:16:48.360
Just do what you were ordered to do.

00:16:48.980 --> 00:16:50.980
That's about 2 kilometers from here.

00:16:50.980 --> 00:16:53.360
As we thought, he's coming this way.

00:16:54.030 --> 00:16:55.110
This is F2.

00:16:55.110 --> 00:16:56.370
We've got a visual on the target.

00:16:56.370 --> 00:16:58.870
Golgo is heading across the crosswalk on 24th Street,

00:16:58.870 --> 00:17:01.870
straight towards the Grand Hotel.

00:17:07.880 --> 00:17:09.000
This is F3.

00:17:09.000 --> 00:17:10.380
We're tailing Golgo.

00:17:11.340 --> 00:17:14.880
He just turned the corner, he's heading east on E Street!

00:17:15.510 --> 00:17:17.220
East on E Street?

00:17:20.390 --> 00:17:23.730
Did he change his direction 'cause he noticed us?

00:17:24.430 --> 00:17:26.810
Where is he going?

00:17:26.810 --> 00:17:29.020
The old abandoned KPR construction site.

00:17:30.480 --> 00:17:35.740
The only place in the area that's high enough to reach a room in the Grand Hotel are the pylons of the KPR.

00:17:36.450 --> 00:17:39.030
T-Then, he's really...

00:17:39.870 --> 00:17:41.240
Golgo 13.

00:17:42.200 --> 00:17:45.410
It seems the rumors are true.

00:17:45.410 --> 00:17:49.500
He most likely intends to strike from the pylons there.

00:17:49.500 --> 00:17:51.670
W-What?

00:17:51.670 --> 00:17:55.840
That's impossible; it's 700 meters from there!

00:17:55.840 --> 00:17:58.260
And it just stopped raining... it's impossible.

00:17:58.260 --> 00:17:59.800
No.

00:17:59.800 --> 00:18:01.850
He can do it.

00:18:06.770 --> 00:18:09.610
But he doesn't know something important;

00:18:09.610 --> 00:18:13.780
that the Don's room on the 21st floor is plated with bulletproof glass.

00:18:15.280 --> 00:18:17.780
Get going, we'll get there ahead of him.

00:18:17.780 --> 00:18:18.490
Yes!

00:18:42.390 --> 00:18:44.770
He did appear.

00:18:45.390 --> 00:18:48.770
But he's going to fail at his job today.

00:18:52.480 --> 00:18:56.280
And today, he will die!

00:19:19.840 --> 00:19:21.300
The poor fool.

00:19:22.050 --> 00:19:26.810
The man who was called the "super-talented sniper" is panicking, and firing randomly at the bulletproof glass.

00:19:31.560 --> 00:19:34.520
So he's finished.

00:19:35.900 --> 00:19:36.940
Listen.

00:19:36.940 --> 00:19:40.780
Golgo must be off his guard because he failed at his job.

00:19:40.780 --> 00:19:43.450
Once he comes down, don't bother facing him in the shadows.

00:19:43.450 --> 00:19:45.830
Face him head on and cut him off!

00:20:42.920 --> 00:20:43.380
Boss?

00:20:43.380 --> 00:20:45.260
You fools!

00:20:48.760 --> 00:20:51.600
At this of all times...

00:20:51.600 --> 00:20:53.770
At this of all times, you fools!

00:20:53.770 --> 00:20:56.020
But boss,

00:20:56.020 --> 00:20:58.270
the family Don was shot!

00:20:59.480 --> 00:21:00.610
What?

00:21:01.280 --> 00:21:03.200
There's no doubt about it!

00:21:03.200 --> 00:21:05.280
I saw it myself!

00:21:05.280 --> 00:21:07.950
That's impossible!

00:21:07.950 --> 00:21:10.160
The boss was shot?

00:21:10.160 --> 00:21:13.040
But the bulletproof glass?

00:21:22.760 --> 00:21:24.590
An M16.

00:21:25.800 --> 00:21:27.430
I see.

00:21:27.430 --> 00:21:36.480
From 700 meters away, he managed to have all his shots hit a single point!

00:21:48.200 --> 00:21:55.500
It became like dynamite striking that one point, and it penetrated the glass.

00:21:55.500 --> 00:21:57.710
No way...

00:21:58.460 --> 00:21:59.710
Boss!

00:21:59.710 --> 00:22:00.880
Mac!

00:22:00.880 --> 00:22:02.130
Lee!

00:22:02.130 --> 00:22:03.630
Herbert!

00:22:42.000 --> 00:22:49.590
Chiisana koto ni zenryoku ni naru kimi no sugata yuuki ni natta hibi

00:22:42.000 --> 00:22:49.590
Those days I saw you giving your all for small things filled me with courage

00:22:49.590 --> 00:22:57.060
Zutto horyuu shippanashi jya ugokenai

00:22:49.590 --> 00:22:57.060
If I keep them suspended then I won't be able to move

00:22:59.060 --> 00:23:06.610
GARASU no HAIWEI ni tatteiru you ni

00:22:59.060 --> 00:23:06.610
It's like I'm standing on a glass highway

00:23:06.610 --> 00:23:13.830
Yume to kiken to senaka awase demo

00:23:06.610 --> 00:23:13.830
Even if I'm standing back to back with dreams and danger

00:23:13.830 --> 00:23:20.960
Kono nagai michi wo sukoshizutsu arukou

00:23:13.830 --> 00:23:20.960
I'll take this long road one step at a time

00:23:20.960 --> 00:23:27.130
Soshite kimi wa ano koro mitai ni

00:23:20.960 --> 00:23:27.130
And I need you to smile

00:23:27.130 --> 00:23:30.130
Waratteite

00:23:27.130 --> 00:23:30.130
Like you did back then

00:23:30.130 --> 00:23:36.770
Shiokaze ni yurete sasayakiatta

00:23:30.130 --> 00:23:36.770
It shook in the sea breeze and whispered

00:23:36.770 --> 00:23:47.360
Kagayaiteita tooi ano hi wa kagerou

00:23:36.770 --> 00:23:47.360
That distant and shining day is a shimmering haze

00:23:45.820 --> 00:23:49.240
The shining days

00:23:49.950 --> 00:23:55.200
Tsumaranai koto ni makeru ni wa hayasugiru

00:23:49.950 --> 00:23:55.200
I can't lose to something so trivial

00:24:02.080 --> 00:24:06.340
An inescapable prison, surrounded by fierce tides.

00:24:06.960 --> 00:24:10.340
Golgo 13 deliberately becomes a prisoner there.

